Signed-off-by: Jiandi An <jan@nvidia.com>
(backported from https://lore.kernel.org/linux-cxl/20260401143917.108413-1-mhonap@nvidia.com/)
(cherry-picked from commit c0f4d247a0e714f22dcd9fe6679132edf1b6a846 from https://github.com/JiandiAnNVIDIA/NV-Kernels.git cxl-vfio_2026-04-23)
Signed-off-by: Koba Ko <kobak@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Jamie Nguyen <jamien@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Matthew R. Ochs <mochs@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Carol L Soto <csoto@nvidia.com>
Signed-off-by: Brad Figg <bfigg@nvidia.com>
(cherry picked from commit 22738eb676af632403fc949226fd029f57806753 26.04-linux-nvidia-bos)
Signed-off-by: Jiandi An <jan@nvidia.com>
